            "review_title": "Review at Pho Hien",
            "review_text": "Clo_Travel_The_World\nHong Kong, China110 contributions\n0\nHidden Gem unknown to tourist! Best Pho in HCMC\nJun 2018 • Couples\nIt’s definitely the best pho among few pho shops we tried in HCMC. The moment you walk in the shop, the amazing frangrant of the broth already made us mouth-watering. \n\nFew variation of beef pho here, specialize menu. Price is very good! The quality of the soup, meat and pho are truly heavenly! \nOnly locals come here, did not see any tourists, so definitely a hidden gem! \n\nThere are more than one Pho Hien in HCMC, don’t mix it up!\nRead more\nWritten June 20, 2018",
